e dead. This is not one of those times... Gram Parsons was one of the most influential musicians of his time; a bitter, brilliant, genius who knew Elvis, tripped with the Stones and fatally overdosed on morphine and tequila in 1973. And from his dying came a story. A story from deep within folklore; a story of friendship, honour and adventure; a story so extraordinary that if it didn't really happen, no one would believe it. Two men, a hearse, a dead rock star, five gallons of petrol, and a promise. And the most extraordinary chase of modern times.","tagline":"It's better to burn out than to fade away."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cl4YFssTisk1NHRVCVjHPgbwTYZ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":16433,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zlI2BXJiVA9YdwSBSSTLj3r9FSg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zlI2BXJiVA9YdwSBSSTLj3r9FSg.jpg","language":"en","width":1179,"height":1767},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8aQtsYD995AxiaifRvdqsLj0GN8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8aQtsYD995AxiaifRvdqsLj0GN8.jpg","language":"en","width":1158,"height":1749},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origin